<title>NETHERLANDS: Hunter Douglas 1996 net rises 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Hunter Douglas 1996 net rises 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     8.93 vs   7.13</p>
<p>    Net profit			   158.3  vs 125.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.50 vs   2.25</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.23 vs   2.06</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   292.0  vs 248.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected window coverings maker Hunter Douglas NV to report a net profit of between 148 million and 160 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
